Package: flux-suite-installer
Version: 0.8.19-3
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Flux Suite
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libqt6core6t64 (>= 6.5), libqt6gui6 (>= 6.5), libqt6network6 (>= 6.5), libqt6svg6 (>= 6.5), libqt6widgets6 (>= 6.5), libssl3t64
Description: Flux Suite application installer and updater
 Installs and updates Flux Motion, Flux Encoder, and the Flux Motion OBS
 plugin from the Flux Suite release feed.
